# 5. SKADI CONSUMPTION MODEL

## Input contract from AEGIS → SKADI

SKADI now processes ALL AEGIS outcomes:

### 5.1 BLOCK

```ts
if (status === "BLOCK") {
  halt_execution();
  write(event_spine, held_by_aegis);
}
```

---

### 5.2 WARN (NEW BEHAVIOR)

```ts
if (status === "WARN") {
  continue_execution();

  write(aegis_warning_log, {
    trace_id,
    severity,
    rule_id,
    payload,
    decision: "WARN"
  });

  tag_execution_trace({
    aegis_state: "WARN"
  });
}
```

---

### 5.3 PASS

```ts
if (status === "PASS") {
  continue_execution();

  write(execution_trace, {
    aegis_state: "PASS"
  });
}
```

